title: Nutanix Prism: Host Hardware Disks (API v4)
agents: nutanix
catalog: virtual/nutanix
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the status of the hardware disk devices in a Nutanix host.
 The disk mount state can be configured through wato.

 The disk is CRIT if it is offline (WARN during a planned outage) and WARN if
 Nutanix reports a status other than NORMAL or flags the disk as unhealthy,
 suspected unhealthy, with errors found in the log, under diagnosis or marked
 for removal. These states are fixed.

 This check requires the Nutanix Prism special agent for API v4 (agent_prism_v4).

item:
 The ID of the disk.

discovery:
 One service is created for each disk.
